623335", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035460_8514674871956668_5536053659043017688_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3BDQJe-GvYoQ7kNvwGWvyI4&_nc_oc=Adoor8qDb2DYbIKIC4d2PBXvZoAGCs3dF23oAaOXaSv_l0y4f_6BRHB9ea9MB3lyl2k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGA3IZjeikfo7MDKYZ3NNqIqIf2l0yhTvGk9et8jJ_iqw&oe=6A7B22E2"}, "display_name": "RCP VR", "keywords": ["CPR", "Training", "FirstAid", "Life", "Medical"], "long_description": "Have you ever wondered how you would react in a medical emergency?\n\nImagine this: you're at work, in a shopping mall, or walking down the street, and suddenly, someone collapses next to you. Would you know what to do?\n\nAt Four Players VR, we\u2019ve developed a Virtual Reality Cardiopulmonary Resuscitation (CPR) simulation that trains you to act with confidence and effectiveness in critical situations.\n\nGet ready to save lives:\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Identify: Recognize a cardiac emergency and immediately activate the response protocol.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Execute: Learn how to properly perform CPR maneuvers, from compressions to ventilation, ensuring the best possible assistance.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Use: Become an expert in the safe and effective use of an AED (automated external defibrillator).\n\nDon\u2019t let fear paralyze you. Join us and gain the skills you need to make a difference in critical moments with Four Players VR!", "short_description": "\u2764\ufe0f Identify: Recognize a cardiac emergency and immediately activate the response protocol.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Execute: Learn how to properly perform CPR maneuvers, from compressions to ventilation, ensuring the best possible assistance.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Use: Become an expert in the safe and effective use of an AED (automated external defibrillator)."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Hero Cover 3000x900-01.png", "id": "1521375421828587", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982664_1521375425161920_9188152085567170692_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5Ql3IvH60YcQ7kNvwERbcpf&_nc_oc=AdoGeeD-KGP2bC3KYV-7aHzhxpmsl3vxThQpHMqHiEiAzPtmtMcDKcV_iQRbIAUJ3H8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEPx3gm_5ZB8U5K8y-418ps_G66FXe5ba1FB1ujcrXmpg&oe=6A7B3073"}, {"file_name": "Cover Art Square 1440x1440-01.png", "id": "1067684668157887", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75221326_1067684671491220_581184548072541025_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xYzMrmofHnIQ7kNvwHW7eiL&_nc_oc=Adrrynewd9UGb0y09LHNSwa0bFNt0W58w4u8B50Lb2ggsNM-ANXemUY0sDvXeuKCQac&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHY08TSpGykcuvvrd-IPWN-YKpkj0Ap0b-_aityxebJpA&oe=6A7B24EB"}, {"file_name": "Logo 9000x1440-01.png", "id": "875705051208789", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75339313_875705054542122_3606485636804263314_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=t8ZOznd_TJUQ7kNvwH3c6fu&_nc_oc=AdrOWmT9u6yNWItTEY8qPKKeDWUmu0o1MgL3A1fr5Z4vKS0C6Tp3e6rtTxGNb-Vo8BU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEXvDdAg1pFfUqM3XVVGtwX1ayeS1luTJcAlzYrkythjg&oe=6A7B09E2"}, {"file_name": "Icon 512x512-01.png", "id": "581195491100081", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57568678_581195494433414_3254618470938933182_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zz5kEdWaKt8Q7kNvwFNO1Qb&_nc_oc=AdqwIQ-mDYxJAp0tzEsRYQj9LsF6pOPEPsyvePwteuHwRTpoZWAESL_177kPbNeArj0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFVTaVpunVYR6MZ5fUaWPA-wSJzKXlIM9jChWOUBLVVCQ&oe=6A7B0C7D"}, {"file_name": "Cover Art Landscape 1008x1440-01.png", "id": "480126738396124", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982658_480126745062790_195688056568553292